            "quote": "Specifically, the roles of Neuropeptide Y, Vasoactive Intestinal Peptide, Calcitonin Gene-Related Peptide, and Substance P and their receptors in key processes of OP were examined, including their function of bone formation and resorption, osteoblast differentiation, and osteoclast differentiation.",
